ut  there there's so many things I haven't  unlocked yet and I've already spent a  lot of time into it and I can't wait to  spend more time into it and that's why  it is my game of 2014 you haven't picked  it up yet because you didn't like it at  first pick it up again it's better it's  worth playing and I  I'm console it was awesome so don't be  afraid to play it on an xbox one or ps4  the controller is just as good it's  awesome it's such a good game play it  right now go  [Music]  [Music]
 

